# White Widow, Free Agent: "When White Widow enters, choose one - ... Return target artifact or enchantment card from your graveyard to
# your hand." Bot2's two Lightning Bolts kill both of Bot1's Ornithopters (artifact creature cards) on turn 2, and Bot1's own Bolt
# kills Bot2's Ornithopter on turn 3, so by turn 5 the graveyards hold: Bot1's two Ornithopters and Lightning Bolt (an instant), Bot2's Bolts and
# Ornithopter. White Widow's second mode offers only Bot1's Ornithopters: not Bot1's Bolt (not an artifact or enchantment) and not
# Bot2's Ornithopter (not in Bot1's graveyard) - the refusals - and returns the chosen one to hand; the other stays.

